00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.690
- This is Northlandz in
Flemington, New Jersey.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:37.703
Northlandz is the world's
largest model railroad.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:41.460
Well, I guess, you know,

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:43.010
everybody has a passion for something.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.100
My thing was trains.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.370
Had trains around the
Christmas tree as a kid.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:48.870
Wherever I lived, I'm
planning track plans;

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.270
and then over 18 years,

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:52.770
I added five basements onto the house.

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:55.190
From that, I got fairly
good at making mountains

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:57.010
and bridges and design-work,

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:58.490
and we decided to give it to the world,

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.780
so we tour it all down, bought this land,

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.360
and built Northlandz.

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:06.160
Any given day, we run
between 85 and 90 trains.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.510
Some of the details in Northlandz inside:

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:10.400
about 40,000 feet of track;

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.340
about 4,000 buildings;

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.050
over 400 bridges;

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:15.100
many of the mountains in here

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.800
are three and a half stories high.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:19.820
Most things in here are scratch-built.

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.730
Underneath the entire super structure,

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:25.250
there's enough lumber to
build about 42 large houses.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:28.410
Takes a few hours to go
through for the average person

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:29.363
to see everything.

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:33.900
We went millions into
debt to build this place.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.370
Everybody thought we were nuts,

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:37.530
and the only one that believed
in what I wanted to do

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.783
was my wife, and she was totally
with me on this big time.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.930
It's an artistic endeavor;

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:46.381
it's a gift to the world of what I can do,

00:01:46.381 --> 00:01:49.152
and it makes a lot of people happy.

00:01:49.152 --> 00:01:52.069
(emotional music)

